<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 16.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 16.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    96/97    103/104     UNQ     188/192</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  102/103   108/109   190/193   200/205</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The strong fuel oil market kept Singapore bunker quotes firm on Friday but traders said enquiries were few and shipowners stayed on the sidelines. As Singapore levels were high, many shipowners have turned to other ports for lower prices, they said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
